; GaiaLabs Retranslation, chapter 22. Dialogue only.

?INCLUDE 'av69_lance'
av69_lance.dialogstring_06BAFA! `[BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: I guess we've[N]finally arrived.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]I think we were walking in[N]the undersea tunnel for[N]about a month in the end…[FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Huh? There's a[N]bulletin board.[END]`
av69_lance.dialogstring_06BB50! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: "Fallen Wing Clan.[N]Travelers may use this[N]room."[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: So that's what[N]the people here call[N]themselves.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Maybe they left the room[N]for travelers because they[N]prefer not to meet them.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Either way, let's rest[N]before exploring.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av69_lily'
av69_lily.dialogstring_06C224! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Will. Let's go…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av69_kara'
av69_kara.dialogstring_06C3B1! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: What is this[N]"Will, let's goˮ…![FIN]You too, Will![N]You're flirting.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]I'm going sightseeing[N]alone! Don't come with[N]me…!![END]`

?INCLUDE 'av69_lily'
av69_lily.dialogstring_06C23C! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: What is she so[N]touchy about…[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Geez, always tha[N]fickle little lady. Leave[N]her alone, I guess.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av69_signs'
av69_signs.dialogstring_06BA36! `[CLD][DEF][CLD][DLG:3,F][SIZ:D,5]Travelers:[N]Please use this room[N]Fallen Wing Clan[END]`
av69_signs.dialogstring_06BA6B! `[CLD][DEF][CLD][DLG:3,F][SIZ:D,5]Entrance to Fallen[N]Wing Village[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6A_lance'
av6A_lance.dialogstring_06BC5C! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Will. Tha thing is,[N]I've got somethin' to[N]discuss with ya…[FIN]I hate to say it, but it[N]seems like I've developed[N]feelin's for Lilly…[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Even when I dream, I only[N]dream o' her… Before I[N]knew it, she had caught[N]my eye.[FIN]Ya think that's not like[N]me, right?[N][PAL:0] Yeah…[N] That isn't true`
av6A_lance.dialogstring_06BD1A! `[CLR][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Will: That's right. I've[N]never thought that you'd[N]be saying things like[N]that.[FIN]`
av6A_lance.dialogstring_06BD4A! `[CLR][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Will: But you've spent a[N]lot of time together by[N]now.[FIN]It wouldn't be unnatural[N]even to be in love with[N]her.[FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Speakin' o' that.[N]It seems like Lilly's[N]fifteenth birthday is[N]comin' up soon.[FIN]I want to tell her my[N]feelin's with a present[N]then, but what do ya think[N]I should go with?[FIN][PAL:0] A pretty bouquet[N] A wonderful necklace[N] A tender kiss[PAL:4]`
av6A_lance.dialogstring_06BE1F! `[CLR][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Will: I don't think[N]there's a girl out there[N]who wouldn't be happy to[N]get a bouquet of flowers.[FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: I guess that's[N]expected.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,5][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Well, I think I can try[N]to communicate a love[N]confession through tha'[N]language of flowers;[N]rosebuds.[FIN][CLD][JMP:&dialogstring_06BF7C]`
av6A_lance.dialogstring_06BE85! `[CLR][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Will: Of course, shouldn't[N]it be something that she[N]regularly wears?[FIN]Because whenever she sees[N]it, she'll think about how[N]Lance is doing.[FIN][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Ah, I get it.[FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Well then, I'll try[N]searching for pretty[N]stones or something like[N]that and making a necklace.[FIN][JMP:&dialogstring_06BF7C]`
av6A_lance.dialogstring_06BF0A! `[CLR][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Will: If you truly like[N]her there's nothing else[N]but this, right?[FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: I feel like doing[N]that all of a sudden would[N]be too bold, but if you[N]say so, should I try it…?[FIN][JMP:&dialogstring_06BF7C]`
av6A_lance.dialogstring_06BF7C! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Thanks fer lending[N]me yer advice.[FIN]I'll try to think of it[N]in my own way. Good[N]friends are nice to have,[N]ain't they.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6A_lily'
av6A_lily.dialogstring_06C2BD! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: The people that[N]call themselves the fallen[N]angel clan live in a[N]gloomy place like this.[FIN]It seems depressing…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6A_erik'
av6A_erik.dialogstring_06C52F! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: The sunlight is[N]so bright, it hurts my[N]eyes if I open them too[N]wide.[WAI][N]Even though it's always[N]been there, I never[N]noticed before.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6A_neil'
av6A_neil.dialogstring_06C0D2! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: I've been wondering[AD][N]Could the Fallen Wings be[N]descendants of the people[N]who escaped Mu?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6B_villagers1'
av6B_villagers1.dialogstring_06C799! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]This is Fallen Wing[N]Village.[WAI][N]Our bodies are weak.[N]Too much sunlight would[N]kill us.[END]`
av6B_villagers1.dialogstring_06C7EF! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]This is Fallen Wing[N]Village.[WAI][N]Our bodies are weak.[N]Too much sunlight would[N]kill us.[END]`
av6B_villagers1.dialogstring_06C845! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]This is Fallen Wing[N]Village.[WAI][N]Our bodies are weak.[N]Too much sunlight would[N]kill us.[END]`
av6B_villagers1.dialogstring_06C9BF! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]This is Fallen Wing[N]Village.[WAI][N]Our bodies are weak.[N]Too much sunlight would[N]kill us.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6B_villagers3'
av6B_villagers3.dialogstring_06CBEE! `[BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]There are stories that say[N]we evolved from humans.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6B_villagers2'
av6B_villagers2.dialogstring_06CB5E! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]A human girl came through[N]here not long ago.[WAI][N]Her name was Kara, or[N]something like that.[WAI][N]Ishtar praised her beauty,[N]and she followed him to[N]his studio.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6B_villagers3'
av6B_villagers3.dialogstring_06CC22! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]I'll tell you how to reach[N]the studio. Remember this.[WAI][N]First, follow the wind.[WAI][N]Watch which way the torch[N]flames bend.[WAI][N]Where the wind is[N]strongest in the dark[N]passage, you'll hear a[N]waterfall.[WAI][N]Search where the sound is[N]loudest.[WAI][N]Ishtar's studio lies[N]beyond there. Be careful.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6C_villagers4'
av6C_villagers4.dialogstring_06CA5C! `[BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]This is something called[N]"danceˮ; a way that humans[N]amuse themselves.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6C_villagers5'
av6C_villagers5.dialogstring_06CD9A! `[BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]We want to get closer to[N]human emotions, so we[N]dance like this every day.[FIN]Even so, nothing changes…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6C_villagers4'
av6C_villagers4.dialogstring_06CA71! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]The picture on that wall[N]was painted by an artist[N]named Ishtar.[WAI][N]But somehow, his models[N]often disappear[N]afterward[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6C_villagers5'
av6C_villagers5.dialogstring_06CDD4! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]We have little emotion,[N]yet Ishtar paints our[N]faces as if they overflow[N]with human warmth.[WAI][N]Perhaps that is why[N]so many people ask him[N]to paint them,[WAI][N]even[N]though his models often[N]disappear.[END]`
av6C_villagers5.dialogstring_06CE56! `[BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]My former dance partner[N]seems to have vanished[AD][WAI][N]So now I practice alone.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6B_ocean_ache'
av6B_ocean_ache.dialogstring_06C714! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]No one remembers when our[N]people first began living[N]here.[WAI][N]Yet when we look at the[N]ocean, something in our[N]chests still aches.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6B_villagers2'
av6B_villagers2.dialogstring_06CB07! `[BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]We have no emotions…[FIN][CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]We never laugh or cry from[N]the day we are born.[FIN]In our lives,[N]every day is the same…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6B_musician'
av6B_musician.dialogstring_06D0C6! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]Woman playing the harp:[N]Music is medicine for the[N]spirit.[WAI][N]A beautiful song can ease[N]pain that no ordinary[N]medicine can reach.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6B_villagers1'
av6B_villagers1.dialogstring_06C981! `[BOR:B][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]I'm a sculptor. Before I[N]die, I intend to make a[N]thousand of these statues…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6C_only_sleeping'
av6C_only_sleeping.dialogstring_06D063! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](They don't react at all[AD][N]It's as if their souls[N]were taken away.)[END]`

?INCLUDE 'av6B_villagers1'
av6B_villagers1.dialogstring_06C8B0! `[BOR:B][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]Do you know the painter,[N]Ishtar?[N][PAL:0] Yes[N] No[PAL:4]`
av6B_villagers1.dialogstring_06C8DC! `[CLR]In that case, you should[N]listen a little more to[N]what everyone has to say.[END]`
av6B_villagers1.dialogstring_06C8F7! `[CLR]The studio of Ishtar, the[N]painter, is on the other[N]side of this door.[FIN][DLG:3,F][SIZ:D,5]But there are creatures[N]with nothing but hatred[N]and a desire for[N]destruction which are[N]roaming beyond this point.[FIN][CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1D]If you say you still want[N]to go despite that, you[N]may open the door.[END]`
